{
  "_about": "CleanPilot skin catalog. Data only, no logic: adding a skin = adding one object to the skins array, no Swift changes and no toolchain rebuild (edit this file on GitHub and open a PR). Array order is the order on the Skins page; the first skin is the default. Missing fields take the defaults below; if the whole file can't be read, the UI falls back to a plain built-in skin instead of going blank.",
  "_fields": {
    "id": "Unique id, lowercase letters and hyphens. Changing it makes it a different skin (users' saved choice is lost)",
    "name": "Skin name. The English source text is the localization key; translations live in Sources/DiskCleaner/Resources/<lang>.lproj/Localizable.strings",
    "tagline": "One-line tagline, localized the same way",
    "tier": "free | premium. Only used for grouping when Channel.showsPricing is true; in the default build all six are available",
    "scheme": "null | light | dark. The skin's own appearance; null follows the system",
    "color": "Colors are #RRGGBB, or with alpha #RRGGBB@0.5",
    "face": "Font design system | rounded | serif",
    "displayWeight": "ultraLight | thin | light | regular | medium | semibold | bold | heavy | black",
    "elevation": "How cards lift off the background: flat (stroke only) | soft (soft shadow) | hard (solid offset shadow) | glass (material plus highlight)",
    "backdrop": "{kind: solid}, or {kind: wash, colors:[...]} vertical gradient, or {kind: aurora, colors:[...]} radial glows, or {kind: fiber, tint, strength} paper texture",
    "motion": "Motion signature still | calm | springy",
    "tileShape": "Icon tile shape circle | squircle | rounded",
    "tileStrategy": "Icon tile coloring: spectrum (one color per category) | duotone (alternating accent and ink)",
    "ring": "Ring material: standard (the shipping one) | crystal (crystal rod with refractive highlights in cross-section). Unknown names fall back to standard without affecting the rest of the skin. Only these values exist because a material is a set of numbers in Swift (Sources/DiskCleaner/Theme/RingStyle.swift); a new material needs numbers added there first. JSON can **pick** a material and a shape but cannot define geometry; the reasoning is in DiskCleanerCore/RingGeometry.swift under \"geometry stays out of config\". Missing field = standard, so old files need no changes.",
    "_rule": "Applies to all skins: body text uses only ink / inkSecondary, never tinted; color goes only to icon tiles, the ring chart, buttons and badges; page headers never get a solid saturated fill."
  },
